uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o4tk071mV_MQ7kNvwHW5NGa&_nc_oc=AdqW9K_zF6COZ2s7dYeNgf2ELU9DzBeJXcAK64DYKczRzumaYAopSOoM3B2G2UbhVl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzJhPQ0HErvjDw1CC84fm8JPa3crzxwyVHctaDc9S9FdQ&oe=69CCF6E4"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W_ZgJe6bdw4Q7kNvwFJdo-G&_nc_oc=Adpo8RObN5346y_7fNIiHYi24_aR5R4lyS9ytJQu0gi3zkRs1KgQ2LKoL-pIMpz5P-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwSUY-z28twpVg3xlWHPvr8vN57vsagQidAiKzTJeOwTA&oe=69CD12AC"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhhvjQ9j9WcQ7kNvwFqUkUo&_nc_oc=AdodGht11jU4lcuMysuTAGrY57l5HgnQbnMTzIMZ-bwD6qmw_Jp3GL0luwG4V4dybOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxGVrsn7Ay2FlGlLh1vbP-iEK-xd5QvLiC5mEdc5qoz4Q&oe=69CD119C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1l1KpSRaljkQ7kNvwEQFvnO&_nc_oc=Adr29nDeJwc5EgRH6I9blLVFv8silvp8_C8sWG_Lf1lbOQCrd77RLHeGhzs3Rg85h6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxOstomBTiIFlbCpgDWZEGARUase95Fu55_CR-ibo-ZIA&oe=69CD051D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJ7jc2Cp1xkQ7kNvwHTe-cg&_nc_oc=AdoVO0uZWzVNd9aHMl-TqdXLwTDikxLTftyemCis_H2li_L7EMH9ySofU4YsUWD0G4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwdbsb1lEy612Ga5u58NVkoIov7JDm249R9s_Ec-ykI8w&oe=69CD0A4F"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "devel